    "description": {
      "value": "This flexible +2 striking sap is crafted from the stalks of cave fungi and bound around a mesh of spore-infused gills. Demon-worshipping xulgaths use spore saps to capture spellcasters alive for later sacrifice.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Traits:** poison\n- **Trigger:** You successfully Strike a creature with the spore sap\n\nThe spore sap releases a puff of stupefying fungal spores. The target must succeed at a DC 28 Fortitude save or become stupefied 1 for 1 minute (stupefied 2 on a critical failure)."
